### :: Test case for issue #6884: when an opam file has fields that are ignored
### :: because of format errors, opam pin edit should say so
### OPAMYES=1
### opam switch create format-errors --empty
### <pkg:format-errors.1>
opam-version: "2.0"
build: [ ["echo" "foo"] "bar" ]
install: [ "true" ]
### opam show --raw format-errors
[ERROR] In the opam file for format-errors.1 from repository default:
          - At packages/format-errors/format-errors.1/opam:2:24-2:29::
            expected [ident-or-string ?{?filter-expression}]
        'build' has been ignored.
opam-version: "2.0"
name: "format-errors"
version: "1"
install: "true"
### opam pin add format-errors 1 --no-action
format-errors is now pinned to version 1
### OPAMEDITOR=cat opam pin edit format-errors --no-action
[ERROR] In the opam file for format-errors.1 from repository default:
          - At packages/format-errors/format-errors.1/opam:2:24-2:29::
            expected [ident-or-string ?{?filter-expression}]
        'build' has been ignored.
opam-version: "2.0"
install: [ "true" ]
name: "format-errors"
version: "1"
[WARNING] The opam file didn't pass validation:
             error 23: Missing field 'maintainer'
           warning 25: Missing field 'authors'
           warning 35: Missing field 'homepage'
           warning 36: Missing field 'bug-reports'
             error 57: Synopsis must not be empty
           warning 68: Missing field 'license'
Proceed anyway ('no' will re-edit)? [Y/n] y
You can edit this file again with "opam pin edit format-errors", export it with "opam show format-errors --raw"
### <format-errors-src/format-errors-src.opam>
opam-version: "2.0"
version: "1"
build: [ ["echo" "foo"] "bar" ]
install: [ "true" ]
### OPAMEDITOR=cat opam pin add ./format-errors-src --edit --no-action
[NOTE] Package format-errors-src does not exist in opam repositories registered in the current switch.
[ERROR] In the opam file in ${BASEDIR}/format-errors-src:
          - At ${BASEDIR}/format-errors-src/format-errors-src.opam:3:24-3:29::
            expected [ident-or-string ?{?filter-expression}]
        'build' has been ignored.
opam-version: "2.0"
version: "1"
install: [ "true" ]
url {
  src: "file://${BASEDIR}/format-errors-src"
}
[WARNING] The opam file didn't pass validation:
             error 23: Missing field 'maintainer'
           warning 25: Missing field 'authors'
           warning 35: Missing field 'homepage'
           warning 36: Missing field 'bug-reports'
           warning 37: Missing field 'dev-repo'
             error 57: Synopsis must not be empty
           warning 68: Missing field 'license'
Proceed anyway ('no' will re-edit)? [Y/n] y
